00:22:32,732 --> 00:22:40,532
本日は、ソラースメジャーデビューライブ ファーストグラビティ＠クラブチッタにご来場いただきまして、誠にありがとうございます。
Thank you very much for attending the SorAZ Major Debut Live "First Gravity" at CLUB CITTA' today.

60
00:22:41,232 --> 00:22:46,032
開演に先立ちまして、ソラマメの皆様にお願いしたいことをお伝えします。
Before the concert starts, we would like to ask a few things of all the Soramame.

61
00:22:47,032 --> 00:22:51,832
客席内でのモッシュ、ダイブ等の危険行為は禁止となります。
Dangerous activities such as mosh pits and diving in the audience seating are prohibited.

62
00:22:52,232 --> 00:22:57,832
以上のことが守られない場合は、公演を一時中断もしくは中止させていただく可能性がございます。
If these rules are not followed, the performance may be temporarily suspended or canceled.

63
00:22:59,032 --> 00:23:03,032
ペンライトは周りのお客さまのご迷惑にならないよう、ご配慮お願いします。
Please be considerate with your penlights so as not to disturb surrounding guests.

64
00:23:04,232 --> 00:23:13,232
頭の上に出したり大きく左右に振り回すと、後ろのお客さまや周りのお客さまのご迷惑となる場合がございます。
Raising them above your head or swinging them widely left and right may cause inconvenience to guests behind or around you.

65
00:23:14,032 --> 00:23:17,832
スタッフが注意させていただく場合がございますので、ご容赦ください。
Staff may give you a warning, so please understand.

66
00:23:18,032 --> 00:23:24,532
本公演は映像配信および写真撮影用のカメラが会場内に入り、お客様の様子が映り込む場合がございます。
Cameras for video broadcasting and photography will be inside the venue for this performance, and guest appearances may be captured.

67
00:23:25,032 --> 00:23:33,832
これらの映像や写真はプロモーション等に使用される可能性がございますので、あらかじめご容赦ください。
Please be aware that these videos and photos may be used for promotions and other purposes.

68
00:23:34,032 --> 00:23:39,032
客席内での携帯電話はスマートフォンの利用は禁止です。
The use of mobile phones and smartphones in the audience seating is prohibited.

69
00:23:39,532 --> 00:23:45,032
携帯電話や音の鳴る機器の電源はあらかじめお切りくださいますようお願い申し上げます。
Please make sure to turn off the power of mobile phones and sound-making devices in advance.

70
00:23:45,532 --> 00:23:55,532
また、携帯電話、スマートフォン等による撮影、録音、録画は固くお断りします。万が一発見した場合は、データ削除の上、ご退場していただく場合がございます。
Also, photography, audio recording, and video recording using mobile phones, smartphones, etc., are strictly prohibited. If discovered, you may be asked to leave after deleting the data.

71
00:24:01,832 --> 00:24:06,832
最後に、ライブの途中で具合が悪くなったりしたらお近くのスタッフにお声がけください。
Lastly, if you feel unwell during the live concert, please speak to a nearby staff member.

72
00:24:07,532 --> 00:24:12,532
また、地震、火事などの非常時はあわてずスタッフの誘導に従って避難していただきますようお願いいたします。
Also, in the event of an emergency such as an earthquake or fire, please do not panic and evacuate according to staff guidance.

73
00:24:18,032 --> 00:24:32,032
配信でご視聴のお客さまへ。本ライブの録音、録画、ミラー配信や違法アップロードは固くお断りいたします。その代わり、スクリーンショットを撮影して映像とともにSNSに投稿していただくことは大歓迎です。本公演のハッシュタグはソラースグラビティとなります。
To our viewers watching via stream: Recording, video recording, mirror streaming, and illegal uploading of this live performance are strictly prohibited. Instead, you are more than welcome to take screenshots and post them on social media along with the footage. The official hashtag for this performance is #SorAZGravity.

74
00:25:15,155 --> 00:25:16,195
もしもしー？
Helloー?

75
00:25:17,540 --> 00:25:19,890
え、みんな聞こえてますかー？
Um, can everyone hear me?

76
00:25:20,040 --> 00:25:21,090
聞こえてるー？
Can you hear me?

77
00:25:21,840 --> 00:25:26,040
マイクテスト！マイクテストだよー！
Mic test! It's a mic test!

78
00:25:26,840 --> 00:25:30,840
みんな聞こえてますかー？
Everyone, can you hear me?

79
00:25:31,040 --> 00:25:36,040
どう？聞こえて…ば、ないともー
How is it? Can you hear... w-well, probably not!

80
00:25:37,540 --> 00:25:41,540
空、空からみんなを見守っています。聞こえてますかー？
Sora's keeping watch over everyone from the sky. Can you hear me?

81
00:25:42,040 --> 00:25:46,540
多分これが見えます。ときのそらでーす。あずきでーす。
You'll probably see this next. This is Tokino Sora. This is AZKi.

82
00:25:47,040 --> 00:25:52,040
まあ、突如としてちょっとお届けしておりますが、ゲリラだよ、ゲリラ！
Well, we're bringing this to you a bit suddenly, it's a guerrilla stream, a guerrilla!

83
00:25:53,040 --> 00:25:57,040
みんな、今どんな気持ち？
Everyone, how are you feeling right now?

84
00:25:57,540 --> 00:25:58,540
え、そんなこと言ってもいいのかな？
Um, is it okay to say things like that?

85
00:25:59,040 --> 00:26:03,040
そんな気持ちを #SorAZGravity でポストしてください！
Please post those feelings with #SorAZGravity!

86
00:26:04,040 --> 00:26:08,540
ポストしてくれる人ー！
Anyone who will post?

87
00:26:09,040 --> 00:26:14,040
ありがとう！トレンド入り目指していこう！えー！
Thank you! Let's aim to trend! Yay!

88
00:26:15,040 --> 00:26:18,540
すごい、みんな、みんな、会いに来てくれてる？
Wow, everyone, everyone, came to see us?

89
00:26:19,040 --> 00:26:24,040
タオルしては…あ、タオルしてくれてる！タオル！
You're wearing towels... Oh, you're wearing towels! Towels!

90
00:26:24,540 --> 00:26:29,540
熱くない？大丈夫？熱いの？これからもっと熱くなりますから。
Isn't it hot? Are you okay? Is it hot? It's going to get even hotter from here.

91
00:26:30,040 --> 00:26:34,540
みんな気をつけて。あ、んだ、みんな仲良くぬんぬんしながらライブみ、ね、ライブ楽しんでこんね！
Everyone be careful. Ah, and everyone enjoy the live while getting along and chilling... I mean, enjoy the live!

92
00:26:35,040 --> 00:26:39,540
なんあ、なんあ、なんあ、え？
Nan ah, nan ah, nan ah, eh?

93
00:26:44,040 --> 00:26:50,040
じゃあみんなもう少し持っててくださーい！のんかじゅー！
Well everyone, please hold on a little longer! Noncajuー!

94
01:05:41,976 --> 01:05:45,476
[Title: SorAZ Major Debut Live First Gravity]

95
01:05:52,236 --> 01:05:56,546
せーのっ せーので！深呼吸 はじまってく ここから ready go!
Ready, go! Take a deep breath, starting right from here, ready go!

96
01:06:00,416 --> 01:06:03,116
みんな来てくれてありがとう！そらちゃんだよー！
Thank you everyone for coming! It's Sora-chan!

97
01:06:07,226 --> 01:06:15,416
大気圏突き抜けて イメージも 歌声も 意識を飛び越えて 響く kira kira
Breaking through the atmosphere, both images and singing voices soar past consciousness and resonate, kira kira...

98
01:06:16,946 --> 01:06:25,996
電子の小宇宙 漂い めぐり会い 瞬間 同期する キセキって groovy
Drifting through an electronic microcosm, meeting by chance, synchronizing in an instant—what a miracle, groovy...

99
01:06:28,936 --> 01:06:35,106
BPM 高まって クルクル回る みんな まるでミラーボール
The BPM is rising, everyone spinning round and round, just like a mirror ball...

100
01:06:38,356 --> 01:06:44,016
わたしたちの夢のファーストブレス 思い切り 遊ぼう
Our dream's first breath, let's play to our heart's content!

101
01:06:44,856 --> 01:06:51,306
A to Z 空を駆けて 振り切っちゃってこう 化学反応で生み出すヒカリ 今ここで 繋がった
Dashing across the sky from A to Z, breaking right through! The light born from chemical reactions connected right here...

102
01:06:56,176 --> 01:07:02,576
照らして 照らし合って せーので！うなずいて はじまってく wonder ready go!
Illuminating each other, nodding together—ready, go! A wonderland beginning, ready go!

103
01:07:08,126 --> 01:07:13,476
トキメキ タップして ひらくは新時代 可能性 その海は なんて amazing!
Tapping into the excitement, opening up a new era—just how amazing is that sea of possibilities!

104
01:07:18,136 --> 01:07:27,466
時代のエーテルに ドキドキ 伝播する 解釈一致でしょ？ 生きるって fantastic
Throbbing and spreading through the era's ether, our interpretations match, right? Living is fantastic...

105
01:07:29,946 --> 01:07:34,716
運命のシンコペーション 星屑のランウェイから 投げるキラービート
Destiny's syncopation, throwing killer beats from the stardust runway...

106
01:07:37,866 --> 01:07:45,066
未知の彼方光るフューチャーサイン キャッチして growing up I と U 奏でるのは ミラクルでいい？
Catching the future sign glowing beyond the unknown, growing up—playing together as I and U, isn't a miracle fine?

107
01:07:50,286 --> 01:07:56,256
以心伝心で まるでテレパス 今という瞬間を 感じて 感じ合って せーので！深呼吸
Telepathic through mutual understanding, feeling and sharing this very moment—ready, go! Take a deep breath...

108
01:07:56,256 --> 01:08:02,166
見たことない wonder キミと 届きますように…
Hoping it reaches you... experiencing an unprecedented wonder together with you...

109
01:08:10,036 --> 01:08:15,056
オモイとオモイが 創るセカイ
A world created by thoughts and feelings...

110
01:08:15,726 --> 01:08:21,756
ここにある ここにいるよ 歌おう 歌えば ひとつになれる
Right here, right here I am, if we sing, if we sing together, we can become one...

111
01:08:25,636 --> 01:08:35,246
もっとなれるよ 自由に ようこそ ここはバイアスのない 二人の EXPO gonna be spacy
We can become even freer. Welcome, this is our bias-free duo EXPO, gonna be spacy!

112
01:08:35,636 --> 01:08:41,466
わたしたちの夢のファーストブレス 思い切り 遊ぼう
Our dream's first breath, let's play to our heart's content!

113
01:08:42,286 --> 01:08:48,616
A to Z 空を駆けて 振り切っちゃって go！ 化学反応で生み出すヒカリ 今ここで 繋がった
Dashing across the sky from A to Z, breaking right through go! The light born from chemical reactions connected right here...

114
01:08:53,716 --> 01:09:00,056
照らして 照らし合って せーので！深呼吸 どこまでも行こうよ
Illuminating each other, taking a deep breath together—ready, go! Let's go anywhere...

115
01:09:00,336 --> 01:09:05,936
せーので！うなずいて はじまってく wonder ready go!
Nodding together—ready, go! A wonderland beginning, ready go!

116
01:09:11,916 --> 01:09:17,236
まだまだ昼公演盛り上がってね！次の曲もいっちょこーよ！
Keep the daytime performance excitement going! Let's go to the next song too!

117
01:09:22,416 --> 01:09:29,376
吸った向こう側の気配 きっと目に映そう
Let's reflect the atmosphere of the other side in our eyes for sure...

118
01:09:40,226 --> 01:09:49,886
誤魔化さず言って言葉積み重ねよう 高すぎる壁さえも跳んでしまうから
Without deceiving ourselves, let's pile up words, because we'll leap over even walls that are too high...

119
01:09:52,236 --> 01:09:59,726
通り抜けたって何も楽しくないって Never enough 君が教えてくれていたんだ
Passing straight through isn't fun at all—you taught me that, saying it's never enough...

120
01:10:00,636 --> 01:10:05,416
あぁ 夢を散々掛け合わせ 時に so, so 間違って
Ah, multiplying dreams over and over, sometimes making so, so many mistakes...

121
01:10:05,712 --> 01:10:07,912
それも laugh, laugh 気にせずに 何度でも挑もう
Laughing it off without a care, let's challenge it as many times as it takes.

122
01:10:10,412 --> 01:10:12,962
だって I know myself 意味のない評価で
Because I know myself. With meaningless evaluations,

123
01:10:14,612 --> 01:10:18,262
世界比べないで 叶えたい本音は
don't compare yourself to the world; the true feeling you want to fulfill

124
01:10:19,712 --> 01:10:23,662
すべてを包み込む太陽 いっそ好き放題上を目指して
is the sun that embraces everything. Aim freely for the heights above,

125
01:10:25,612 --> 01:10:29,312
立ちはだかる壁を登って 刻んでいきたいな
climbing the walls that stand in our way, I want to carve them into our path,

126
01:10:29,962 --> 01:10:34,862
そして次に臨む 越えたいあの未来
and towards the future we wish to surpass next...

127
01:10:34,862 --> 01:10:37,412
越えたいあの未来
...that future we want to surpass!

128
01:10:47,312 --> 01:10:51,912
想像したら 鼓動が聞こえたんだ
When I imagined it, I could hear my heartbeat.

129
01:10:52,362 --> 01:10:57,762
作り込んだ道なんて 全部従わず行こう
Let's go on without following any manufactured paths.

130
01:10:58,162 --> 01:11:03,162
響く音のまま 心が赴くまま ずっと
Just as the sound echoes, just as our hearts lead us, forever.

131
01:11:03,412 --> 01:11:08,712
君なら 君なら 一緒になんでも築ける
If it's with you, with you, we can build anything together.

132
01:11:18,762 --> 01:11:22,912
躓いて視界が何も見えなくなっても
Even if we stumble and our vision goes completely dark,

133
01:11:23,662 --> 01:11:28,012
振り向いて 笑える そんな場所がある
there's a place where we can turn back and smile.

134
01:11:28,562 --> 01:11:33,962
ただ楽しもう 夢を散々掛け合わせ
Let's just enjoy it, interweaving our dreams to the fullest.

135
01:11:34,512 --> 01:11:38,962
時に so, so 間違って それも laugh, laugh 気にせずに
Sometimes making mistakes, but laughing them off without a care,

136
01:11:39,412 --> 01:11:43,762
何度でも挑もう いつも be yourself
let's challenge it as many times as it takes, always be yourself.

137
01:11:44,112 --> 01:11:48,662
試さないとほら 何も始まらない
If we don't try, see, nothing begins.

138
01:11:49,362 --> 01:11:54,762
些細な勇気で 明日を変えるまでもっと
With a little courage, until we change tomorrow even more.

139
01:11:55,012 --> 01:11:58,262
意味のない評価で 世界比べないで
With meaningless evaluations, don't compare it to the world.

140
01:11:59,112 --> 01:12:05,362
叶えたい本音は すべてを包み込む太陽 いっそ
The true feeling we want to make come true is the sun that embraces everything.

141
01:12:05,662 --> 01:12:10,912
好き放題上を目指して 立ちはだかる壁を登って
Aim freely for the heights above, climbing the walls that stand in our way,

142
01:12:11,562 --> 01:12:16,062
刻んでいきたいな そして次に臨む
I want to carve them in, and the future we hope for next...

143
01:12:16,362 --> 01:12:23,012
越えたいあの未来 抱こう 壮大な未来
...that future we want to surpass, let's embrace a grand future.

144
01:13:08,512 --> 01:13:12,162
はじめから僕らは 繋がっていたんだ
We were connected right from the start

145
01:13:12,612 --> 01:13:19,012
引力で 出会えたのは必然 君も気づいてるのかな
Meeting through gravity was inevitable; I wonder if you've noticed too.

146
01:13:19,212 --> 01:13:24,962
遥か宇宙から見たぼくらは まるでちっぽけな星屑
Seen from the distant cosmos, we look like tiny stardust.

147
01:13:27,512 --> 01:13:33,662
君と出会えた瞬間に 僕ら星座になれたの
The moment we met, stardust, we were able to become a constellation.

148
01:13:37,512 --> 01:13:41,012
時間を超えて don't stop, 未来へ
Crossing time, don't stop, toward the future,

149
01:13:41,312 --> 01:13:45,412
二つ重ねて超絶ミラクル
two overlapping into a supreme miracle.

150
01:13:45,512 --> 01:13:52,012
誰も止められない魔法 レベチな僕らの銀河へ party night
A magic no one can stop, our galaxy party night on another level.

151
01:13:54,012 --> 01:14:02,012
2人は destiny 引力に引かれ光る clarity ドキドキして愛してねぇ ワクワクして
We are destiny, shining clarity drawn by gravity. Heart pounding, loving, hey, getting excited.

152
01:14:02,512 --> 01:14:11,512
2人の gravity 感情のままに so dance music すれ違いもまた groovy 始めようぜ僕らの gravity
Our gravity, letting emotions guide our dance music. Misunderstandings are also groovy, let's start our gravity.

153
01:14:13,512 --> 01:14:20,512
見つめてて朝が来るまで
Keep gazing until morning comes.

154
01:14:29,512 --> 01:14:35,512
これが完全無欠な illusion まさに完璧な fusion
This is a flawless illusion, truly a perfect fusion.

155
01:14:36,512 --> 01:14:42,512
歌い踊れば solution ここは僕たちの region
Singing and dancing is the solution, and this is our region.

156
01:14:43,512 --> 01:14:48,512
みんなの力が重なり広がる たった1つの universe
Everyone's powers overlap and expand into the one and only universe.

157
01:14:49,512 --> 01:14:55,512
ねぇちょっと泣いたって 明日は晴れる take it easy
Hey, even if you cry a little, tomorrow will be clear, take it easy.

158
01:14:56,512 --> 01:15:04,512
1人でいないで hold on 繋がるいつでも未来で let's meet up
Don't be alone, hold on. We'll always connect in the future, let's meet up.

159
01:15:05,840 --> 01:15:07,660
絶対見逃さないで
Never look away,

160
01:15:07,660 --> 01:15:10,720
感じて 迷い込んで
feel it, get lost in it,

161
01:15:10,940 --> 01:15:13,340
これぞ Infinity
this is Infinity!

162
01:15:13,640 --> 01:15:15,660
輝く前に
Before we shine,

163
01:15:15,660 --> 01:15:20,860
Try doing 自分でも怖いけど
try doing it yourself even if you're scared,

164
01:15:20,860 --> 01:15:24,980
これからは僕らの Gravity
from now on, it's our Gravity.

165
01:15:25,160 --> 01:15:28,760
ついてきて たどり着くまで　Yeah!
Follow us until we reach it, yeah!

166
01:15:35,560 --> 01:15:39,320
何回でも星座を作るよ
No matter how many times, we'll create constellations

167
01:15:39,320 --> 01:15:44,840
2人で 幾千の空へ
together, into thousands of skies...

168
01:15:44,840 --> 01:15:48,880
待ってて未来へ
waiting for the future!

169
01:15:51,560 --> 01:15:57,780
ふたりは Destiny　強くなる絆はまだ so Growing
We are Destiny... the bond growing stronger is still so growing,

170
01:15:58,080 --> 01:16:03,000
ドキドキして 愛して ねぇ、ワクワクして
heart beating, loving, hey, getting excited,

171
01:16:03,000 --> 01:16:08,700
2人の GRAVITY　勘違いだらけでも Alright
Our GRAVITY... even full of misunderstandings, it's alright,

172
01:16:08,700 --> 01:16:14,640
つまずいてもまだ Groovy　始めようぜ僕らの GRAVITY
even if we stumble, still Groovy, let's start our GRAVITY,

173
01:16:14,640 --> 01:16:19,800
見つめてて朝が来るまで　Yeah!
keep watching until morning comes, yeah!

174
01:16:42,560 --> 01:16:48,600
First Gravity!

175
01:16:49,120 --> 01:16:54,640
ふたり合わせて　せーの！　空を抜け出せ！
Together with us, ready, go! Break through the sky!

176
01:16:57,760 --> 01:17:02,040
お待たせしました！お待たせしました皆さん！
Sorry to keep you waiting! Thank you for waiting, everyone!

177
